# Class-table features are rules text unless an explicit PCGen numeric grant is present.
Symbiat Psionics Rounds (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_SYMBIAT_PSIONICS_ROUNDS|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_SYMBIAT_PSIONICS_ROUNDS|4+INT+2*(SPHERES_SYMBIAT_LEVEL-1)	DESC:%SPHERES_SYMBIAT_PSIONICS_ROUNDS rounds per day of psionic effects; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
Symbiat Pushed Movement Feet (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_SYMBIAT_PUSHED_MOVEMENT_FEET|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_SYMBIAT_PUSHED_MOVEMENT_FEET|10*if(SPHERES_SYMBIAT_LEVEL>=3,1,0)+10*if(SPHERES_SYMBIAT_LEVEL>=6,1,0)+10*if(SPHERES_SYMBIAT_LEVEL>=9,1,0)+10*if(SPHERES_SYMBIAT_LEVEL>=12,1,0)+10*if(SPHERES_SYMBIAT_LEVEL>=15,1,0)+10*if(SPHERES_SYMBIAT_LEVEL>=18,1,0)	DESC:%SPHERES_SYMBIAT_PUSHED_MOVEMENT_FEET feet of bonus movement when pushed movement is active; consult class rules before applying in play.
Symbiat Battlefield AC (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_SYMBIAT_BATTLEFIELD_AC|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_SYMBIAT_BATTLEFIELD_AC|1*if(SPHERES_SYMBIAT_LEVEL>=4,1,0)+1*if(SPHERES_SYMBIAT_LEVEL>=8,1,0)+1*if(SPHERES_SYMBIAT_LEVEL>=12,1,0)+1*if(SPHERES_SYMBIAT_LEVEL>=16,1,0)+1*if(SPHERES_SYMBIAT_LEVEL>=20,1,0)	DESC:%SPHERES_SYMBIAT_BATTLEFIELD_AC AC bonus only when battlefield sense conditions are satisfied; consult class rules before applying in play.
Symbiat Class Features 1	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 1: Battlefield sense, casting, mental powers, psionics, spell pool. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/symbiat for effects, timing and prerequisites.
